# Server builds need only Go source/migrations and the Keycloak build definition.
# Do not send private history, local secrets, client media or platform caches.
**
!services/
!services/api-go/
!services/api-go/**
!services/api/
!services/api/migrations/
!services/api/migrations/**
!infrastructure/
!infrastructure/keycloak/
!infrastructure/keycloak/Dockerfile
**/.env*
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.enc*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p8
**/bin/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
**/coverage/
**/*.log
